KONOHAGAKURE — DIRECTORY OF FOUNDING AND NOTABLE CLANS
For new shinobi reference

The Hidden Leaf was built from the union of many warring clans. New shinobi should be familiar with the major clans and their kekkei genkai / specialties:

- Senju — Founding clan of Hashirama, First Hokage. Wood Release.
- Uchiha — Founding clan. Sharingan dojutsu; fire-natured techniques.
- Hyuga — Byakugan dojutsu; Gentle Fist taijutsu. Main and Branch houses.
- Nara — Shadow Imitation techniques; renowned strategists.
- Akimichi — Body Expansion techniques; partnered traditionally with Nara and Yamanaka.
- Yamanaka — Mind Transfer techniques; sensory and intelligence work.
- Inuzuka — Ninken (ninja hound) partnership; enhanced senses.
- Aburame — Kikaichu insect hosts; tracking and sabotage.
- Sarutobi — Lineage of the Third Hokage; versatile.

The Ino-Shika-Cho formation (Yamanaka-Nara-Akimichi) remains a traditional generational trio. Direct clan-specific questions to the respective clan heads via the Administration Building.
